@loader info
@event sim:load
Drop a .zzt file onto the cafe window to open that world here.
$7
You can also pull worlds from the Museum of ZZT. 
Type #zztsearch town to look up worlds by title. 
Add a field name to search something else:
$7
"#zztsearch author draco
"#zztsearch genres adventure
$7
The fields are: title, letter, author, genres, filename, screenshot, and publish_date.
Each hit lists the title, author, genres, and date. 
$7
Type #zztrandom to do the same with one world picked at random.
